WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Don't move around. There is no way to get stitches. If there is heavy bleeding, you will die.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
If you want to leave, you must let Zhang Yi exchange medicines, otherwise you will never even think of stepping out of the room.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
If you want to leave, take me with you. Don't leave me alone.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,890
Brother Zhang Yi, they are holding me captive and won't let me leave. Can you give them some medicine first and help me get there.

5
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:25,270
Medicines are very precious, how can I be sure that they will not hold you hostage and threaten me?

6
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:28,270
What if you are used as a bargaining chip to continuously extort supplies?

7
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:30,270
Qin'er, we can't be fooled.

8
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,270
Don't you understand? He is already dead.

9
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:35,270
Don't believe it, Yuqin, he has been lying to you from beginning to end.

10
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:38,981
Let's go together

11
00:00:38,981 --> 00:00:42,691
Want to run away alone

12
00:00:42,691 --> 00:00:45,660
Absolutely impossible
